.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Not needed inside the image (only used by the host to build/run it) —
# excluding them so doc/compose-only edits don't bust the COPY cache and
# force a full pip reinstall.
docker/docker-compose.yml
docker/DOCKER.md

# Generated data — mounted as volumes instead, not baked into the image
robo_manip_baselines/dataset
robo_manip_baselines/checkpoint

# third_party submodules genuinely unused by the image: real-hardware /
# multi-venv / non-pip policies out of scope for this container (see
# "Policies not included" in DOCKER.md), plus sim benchmark suites unrelated
# to RMB's own MuJoCo envs.
third_party/YCB_sim
third_party/gello_software
third_party/lerobot
third_party/pyorbbecsdk
third_party/tacto

# roboagent/detr and act/detr both build a package literally named "detr" —
# installing both editable in one image would make the second install shadow
# the first (see DOCKER.md notes). MT-ACT's scripts resolve `detr` purely via
# their own sys.path.append at runtime, so third_party/roboagent's source
# ships (not excluded above) but the Dockerfile deliberately never runs
# `pip install -e` on it; only act/detr gets the "detr" registration.

# Same story for pytorch3d: 3D-Diffusion-Policy, FlowPolicy and ManiFlow each
# vendor a package named "pytorch3d". All three call only
# pytorch3d.ops.sample_farthest_points, which the "simplified" fork provides,
# so the Dockerfile installs that once and shares it — ManiFlow's full
# pytorch3d source is excluded to avoid a redundant, much heavier CUDA build.
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/pytorch3d

# Vendored benchmark-suite environments (Metaworld/Adroit/DexArt/RoboTwin/
# VRL3/old mujoco-py/gym) that ship inside 3D-Diffusion-Policy, FlowPolicy and
# ManiFlow_Policy — none of these are imported by the modules RMB's
# Train/Rollout scripts actually use (only .policy/.model/.common), so they'd
# just bloat the build context. Re-include if you want to run those upstream
# benchmark tasks directly.
third_party/3D-Diffusion-Policy/third_party/VRL3
third_party/3D-Diffusion-Policy/third_party/Metaworld
third_party/3D-Diffusion-Policy/third_party/dexart-release
third_party/3D-Diffusion-Policy/third_party/mujoco-py-2.1.2.14
third_party/3D-Diffusion-Policy/third_party/gym-0.21.0
third_party/3D-Diffusion-Policy/third_party/rrl-dependencies
third_party/FlowPolicy/third_party/VRL3
third_party/FlowPolicy/third_party/Metaworld
third_party/FlowPolicy/third_party/mujoco-py-2.1.2.14
third_party/FlowPolicy/third_party/gym-0.21.0
third_party/FlowPolicy/third_party/rrl-dependencies
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/VRL3
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/Metaworld
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/dexart-release
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/RoboTwin1.0
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/mujoco-py-2.1.2.14
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/gym-0.21.0
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/rrl-dependencies
third_party/ManiFlow_Policy/third_party/visualizer
